OAO6SJc7YLWvh","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T13:03:08Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:04:28Z","body":"Not sure if this is a bug, the code that fetches classes to use is this:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/dec5a373d97cbadce5e1fabe6095ae9957ff3aa6/editor/script/editor_script_plugin.cpp#L56-L59\n\nWhich fetches only direct inheritors, so it might or might not be intentional to use this, but this is not really documented clearly anywhere, so needs to be evaluated what is the intended behavior here\n\nThe documentation says \"Scripts extending this class and implementing its `_run()` method\" which implies direct inheritance, but it's not clear cut","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626855393/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626861053","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113749#issuecomment-3626861053","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113749","id":3626861053,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YLYH9","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T13:04:47Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:04:47Z","body":"I wrote this originally and I simply didn't know the method does not collect transitive inheritors. There is not technical reason to not include them and this should be an easy fix (preferably with a utility method in `ScriptServer`).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626861053/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626870065","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113749#issuecomment-3626870065","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113749","id":3626870065,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YLaUx","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T13:07:27Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:54:39Z","body":"I'd not consider fetching all inheriting classes a trivial task so I'd not consider this a good first issue, it'd depend on a lot of factors, fetching transitively from the inheriting classes could get convoluted","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3626870065/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3627052295","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113749#issuecomment-3627052295","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113749","id":3627052295,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YMG0H","user":{"login":"hatmix","id":67128187,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MTI4MTg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67128187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix","html_url":"https://github.com/hatmix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hatmix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-08T13:53:01Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T14:12:38Z","body":"Consider how a plugin author might workaround this issue to make the command palette work for user scripts based on their plugin's extended EditorScript.\n\n1. Use or write something like [DirectoryWatcher](https://github.com/KoBeWi/Godot-Directory-Watcher) to notice when users add/modity/remove script files.\n2. For each script file modification, parse file content looking for the plugin's appropriate class_name or trust that ClassDB is updated quickly enough and use it's methods. I don't think there's a way to know for certain when ClassDB is updated for file changes.\n3. Add or remove the user script to/from the command palette.  \n\nPerhaps there's a better workaround approach.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3627052295/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]